        <mxCell id="after" value="&lt;b&gt;After the role is known&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Capability lookup in the matrix (page 3).&lt;br&gt;2. Field-level rules for issue edits (page 4).&lt;br&gt;3. Resource state: archived project / issue blocks mutations (FR-PRJ-004).&lt;br&gt;4. Concurrency: version check (FR-ISS-008).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Platform Super Admin&lt;/b&gt; never enters this tree: it is resolved by the separate /platform guard and has no tenant role." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa500;" vertex="1" parent="1">
