        <mxCell id="hdr_sub" value="Rows 1–19 transcribe SRS v3 §4 exactly. Rows marked ◆ restate numbered FRs/invariants (no new policy). PM* / Member* require ACTIVE membership of the specific project; Owner/Admin reach all workspace projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#666666'&gt;&lt;i&gt;Traceability: SRS v3 §4 (+ footnote), §6; FR-TEN-004/006/008, FR-ISS-005/007/010, FR-RPT-001, FR-ADM-002/003/004; AC-03, AC-04, AC-06, AC-09, AC-20&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
