        <mxCell id="mnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;¹ The Owner cannot remove or demote themself while owning; ownership must be transferred first (atomic).&lt;br&gt;• Member field limits: title, description, due date and status only on own assigned / reported issues; cannot change project, assignee, sprint, story points or priority (page 4).&lt;br&gt;• 'WS Member (no project row)' and 'Platform Super Admin' columns are derived: SRS §4 says PM/Member need project membership and that the Super Admin is outside the matrix.&lt;br&gt;• Every 'Y' is still subject to: workspace not suspended, project/issue not archived for mutations, version check, tenant ancestry check." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa500;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1188" width="1490" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
